Z||000015||FieroGT 914||09-25-2001||12:59 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Veronica's V6 GT:<BR><B>Hi Jen, it was a nice surprise to see you and Joe there.  You have been full of a lot of surprises lately. Get some sleep. See you in a few weeks.<P>Vonnie</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Thanks Vonnie - I was glad Jen and I could make it too!  It was a lot of fun surprising everyone since they didn't think we'd make it and it was great to see such a great turnout on such a gorgeous day.  Hope to see everyone at the tech session in two weeks!<P>------------------<BR>Joe<P>        <IMG SRC="http://www.personal.psu.edu/users/j/j/jjr161/FieroGT914_Signature.gif">         <BR>AOL I.M.: FieroGT 914<BR>White 86 1/2 GT (Stock)<BR>Maroon 87 GT (Mod)<BR><A HREF="http://www.personal.psu.edu/~jjr161" TARGET=_blank>My Website</A>||||reg||12
